   "widgets_values": [
    "## yue2-cover (dev copy)\n\n**The restyle route E5 could not have** - ACE-Step keeps a reference but cannot restyle it; YuE's cover\n*melody-transplants*: `SheetSage2AudioToABC` transcribes the reference's melody into ABC notation (previewed\nhere, exactly as the shipped cover template does), and `YuE2GenerateMusic(mode='melody')` re-renders from\nthat ABC with a **new style and new lyrics supplied as text** (the shipped cover template does the same - its\ninstance carries its own lyric).\n\n**Inputs:** reference `input/e5_reference.flac` (the E5 reference: 30.00 s, instrumental - no words to keep,\nhence fresh lyrics), style *industrial rock*, lyrics our own \"Iron heart\" (song form, repeated chorus), seed\n`0`, `max_duration` 30 s so the cover is length-comparable with the reference, sampler as shipped.\n\n**Licence:** weights are `cc-by-nc-4.0` (`Comfy-Org/YuE2`) - **research only**, nothing here can ship.\n\n**What to measure:** the ABC actually transcribed (is the melody legible?), levels + spectrogram against the\nreference, and the user's ears for \"same tune, industrial\". **Dev copy** - the shippable route for this\ncapability stays ACE-Step's MIT Cover mode (upstream's app).\n"
   ],
   "properties": {},
   "order": 0
  }
